      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Access Control",
      "Anchor": "organization-access-control",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Organization Access Control API returns the organization\u2019s access control information, such as the list of admins authorized to access the organization page data.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Access Control",
      "Anchor": "organization-access-control",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Access Control",
      "Anchor": "organization-access-control",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Finder roleAssignee to get an access control information by role assignee.\nFinder organization to get an access control information by organization.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
